      "source_url": "https://app.notion.com/p/3fafaa7adad8817798d1e3308c0af393?d=3fafaa7adad880cd9df0001c43eed7d9&pvs=42#7cb3527c42724e72992995cd61cf8813",
      "text_context": "有多少属于“人类先验”",
      "resolved": false,
      "comment_count": 2,
      "comments": [
        {
          "id": "3fafaa7a-dad8-8016-beae-001d6136b535",
          "author": "远山江浸月",
          "datetime": "2026-10-15T10:21:46.669Z",
          "by_you": true,
          "html": "“人类先验”特指人类工程师将自己对特定业务流程、求解逻辑和安全规范的理解，硬编码进系统中的规则与约束。"
        },
        {
          "id": "3fafaa7a-dad8-80ac-b055-001d833dcb12",
          "author": "远山江浸月",
          "datetime": "2026-10-15T10:30:11.266Z",
          "by_you": true,
          "html": "• 硬编码工作流：人工编排的 DAG、固定调用顺序（如“必须先检索知识库，再调用计算器，最后调用总结工具”）。<br>• 格式与验证校验：用正则表达式、Pydantic Schema 死锁输入输出，强制模型按照人类预想的接口通信。<br>• 启发式 Prompt 与反思机制：在 Harness 中预埋固定句式（“请一步一步思考”、“检查你的答案是否符合某规范”）。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "anchor": "notion-discussion-02",
      "id": "discussion://3fafaa7a-dad8-8177-98d1-e3308c0af393/68ad389e-8353-4d1c-995a-4ba1d9f2ca69/3fafaa7a-dad8-8074-bebe-001c8d37417a",
      "source_url": "https://app.notion.com/p/3fafaa7adad8817798d1e3308c0af393?d=3fafaa7adad88074bebe001c8d37417a&pvs=42#68ad389e83534d1c995a4ba1d9f2ca69",
      "text_context": "2026 年以来，生...下文末尾而不破坏前缀",
      "resolved": false,
      "comment_count": 1,
      "comments": [
        {
          "id": "3fafaa7a-dad8-8069-a429-001dc523610b",
          "author": "远山江浸月",
          "datetime": "2026-10-15T10:48:25.638Z",
          "by_you": true,
          "html": "Claude Code 全面落地 MCP Tool Search / 惰性加载（2026 年 1 月）在工程落地端，Anthropic 针对其开发工具 Claude Code 正式推送了 MCP Tool Search（Lazy Loading）：<br>• 自动阈值触发：当检测到挂载的 MCP 工具描述超过 10,000 Token（或占上下文窗口 10% 以上）时，系统自动切入惰性加载模式，不再全量注入。<br>• 85%~95% Token 瘦身：原本冷启动需要消耗 5 万～10 万 Token 的庞大 MCP 环境，初始 Token 占用被压制到 500 Token 左右。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "anchor": "notion-discussion-03",
      "id": "discussion://3fafaa7a-dad8-8177-98d1-e3308c0af393/68ad389e-8353-4d1c-995a-4ba1d9f2ca69/3fafaa7a-dad8-8023-af6a-001cdb030500",
      "source_url": "https://app.notion.com/p/3fafaa7adad8817798d1e3308c0af393?d=3fafaa7adad88023af6a001cdb030500&pvs=42#68ad389e83534d1c995a4ba1d9f2ca69",
      "text_context": "不破坏前缀",
      "resolved": false,
      "comment_count": 1,
      "comments": [
        {
          "id": "3fafaa7a-dad8-8008-9d3d-001df8e7805a",
          "author": "远山江浸月",
          "datetime": "2026-10-15T10:50:44.290Z",
          "by_you": true,
          "html": "Prompt Caching（提示词前缀缓存）。<br><br>前缀缓存的约束（Prefix-Match）：大模型服务商的上下文缓存机制严格要求前缀完全一致。如果将动态加载、频繁变动的工具 Schema 放置在上下文前端（如插入在系统提示词或静态工具区），任何一个工具的加载或卸载都会导致后续所有 Token 的缓存键（Cache Key）失效，造成 100% 的重新计算，极大拉高推理延迟和 Token 成本。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "anchor": "notion-discussion-04",
      "id": "discussion://3fafaa7a-dad8-8177-98d1-e3308c0af393/1c962396-900d-49d3-81b2-fb4a60c6787a/3fafaa7a-dad8-8021-9575-001c890dc4bd",
      "source_url": "https://app.notion.com/p/3fafaa7adad8817798d1e3308c0af393?d=3fafaa7adad880219575001c890dc4bd&pvs=42#1c962396900d49d381b2fb4a60c6787a",
      "text_context": "传统方式中，模型调用...一样有很多格式限制。",
      "resolved": false,
      "comment_count": 1,
      "comments": [
        {
          "id": "3fafaa7a-dad8-8014-a66b-001d93099cb0",
          "author": "远山江浸月",
          "datetime": "2026-10-15T11:08:28.356Z",
          "by_you": true,
          "html": "<br>  客户端必须提供完整的 JSON Schema，显式声明输入字段类型：<br><br><code class=\"comment-code\">{  &quot;type&quot;: &quot;function&quot;,  &quot;function&quot;: {    &quot;name&quot;: &quot;python_interpreter&quot;,    &quot;description&quot;: &quot;执行 Python 脚本并返回标准输出&quot;,    &quot;parameters&quot;: {      &quot;type&quot;: &quot;object&quot;,      &quot;properties&quot;: {        &quot;code&quot;: {          &quot;type&quot;: &quot;string&quot;,          &quot;description&quot;: &quot;待执行的完整 Python 代码&quot;        }      },      &quot;required&quot;: [&quot;code&quot;]    }  }}</code>模型返回的 Tool Call Payload大模型为了保证输出是合法 JSON，必须对代码内部的所有换行、双引号、反斜杠做严格转义：<br><br><code class=\"comment-code\">{  &quot;id&quot;: &quot;call_abc123&quot;,  &quot;type&quot;: &quot;function&quot;,  &quot;function&quot;: {    &quot;name&quot;: &quot;python_interpreter&quot;,    &quot;arguments&quot;: &quot;{\\&quot;code\\&quot;: \\&quot;import re\\\\n\\\\ntext = \\\\\\&quot;Latency: 24ms, Cost: $0.05\\\\\\&quot;\\\\npattern = r&#x27;\\\\\\\\d+\\\\\\\\.\\\\\\\\d+|\\\\\\\\d+&#x27;\\\\nmatches = re.findall(pattern, text)\\\\nprint(f\\\\\\&quot;Extracted numbers: {matches}\\\\\\&quot;)\\&quot;}&quot;  }}</code><br><span underline=\"true\"><strong>核心痛点</strong></span>：<code>arguments</code> 是一个双重序列化的字符串。为了逃逸代码中的 <code>&quot;</code> 和 <code>\\d</code>，模型必须生成 <code>\\\\\\&quot;</code> 和 <code>\\\\\\\\d</code>。一旦生成数百行长代码，极易因某处转义缺失引发 <code>json.decoder.JSONDecodeError</code>，并且额外消耗了大量无意义的转义 Token。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "anchor": "notion-discussion-05",
      "id": "discussion://3fafaa7a-dad8-8177-98d1-e3308c0af393/1c962396-900d-49d3-81b2-fb4a60c6787a/3fafaa7a-dad8-8057-aa0a-001cd8cd3e00",
      "source_url": "https://app.notion.com/p/3fafaa7adad8817798d1e3308c0af393?d=3fafaa7adad88057aa0a001cd8cd3e00&pvs=42#1c962396900d49d381b2fb4a60c6787a",
      "text_context": "自由格式工具调用（在...SON 转义的麻烦。",
      "resolved": false,
      "comment_count": 1,
      "comments": [
        {
          "id": "3fafaa7a-dad8-8015-9da5-001d24777cd6",
          "author": "远山江浸月",
          "datetime": "2026-10-15T11:10:58.903Z",
          "by_you": true,
          "html": "自由格式调用直接抛弃了外部 JSON 字段 Schema 限制，允许模型将一段裸文本（Raw Text）作为输入直接投递给目标工具。工具声明（Tool Definition）在声明工具时直接指定类型为 <code>custom</code>，无需嵌套的 properties 约束：<br><br><code class=\"comment-code\">{  &quot;type&quot;: &quot;custom&quot;,  &quot;name&quot;: &quot;python_runner&quot;,  &quot;description&quot;: &quot;接受原生多行 Python 代码并在沙箱中执行，返回 stdout/stderr&quot;}</code>模型返回的 Tool Call Payload模型输出不再做字符转义，直接流式生成原始文本：<br><br><code class=\"comment-code\">{  &quot;id&quot;: &quot;call_xyz789&quot;,  &quot;type&quot;: &quot;custom&quot;,  &quot;name&quot;: &quot;python_runner&quot;,  &quot;input&quot;: &quot;import re\\n\\ntext = \\&quot;Latency: 24ms, Cost: $0.05\\&quot;\\npattern = r&#x27;\\\\d+\\\\.\\\\d+|\\\\d+&#x27;\\nmatches = re.findall(pattern, text)\\nprint(f\\&quot;Extracted numbers: {matches}\\&quot;)&quot;}</code><em>在底层传输或流式输出时，<strong><code>input</code></strong> 字段承载的就是纯文本块，甚至可以直接以 Markdown 语法块的形式流出，模型不再进行 <strong><code>\\&quot;</code></strong> 或 <strong><code>\\\\\\\\</code></strong> 等繁琐的人工转义</em>。<br>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
